  "block": "21 00",
  "method": "Each address in the block was asked on its own, at the pair the write probe measured it to accept, and the records are read back together here. The block is counted against the plan rather than against the files present, so an address that was never asked cannot read as one that answered.",
  "asked_in": {
    "plain": [
